Algorithm

Algorithm: Food Order Management System

Step 1: Start.
Step 2: Create a Node structure containing:
Order ID
Food Item
Quantity
Pointer to the next node
Step 3: Initialize head = NULL.
Step 4: Display the menu:
Add Order
Delete Order
Search Order
Display Orders
Exit
Step 5: For Add Order:
Create a new node dynamically.
Enter Order ID, Food Item and Quantity.
Insert the node at the end of the linked list.
Step 6: For Delete Order:
Enter the Order ID.
Search for the matching node.
If found, remove the node and release its memory.
Otherwise, display "Order not found".
Step 7: For Search Order:
Enter the Order ID.
Traverse the linked list.
If the ID matches, display the order details.
Otherwise, display "Order not found".
Step 8: For Display Orders:
Start from head.
Traverse each node.
Display Order ID, Food Item and Quantity.
Step 9: Repeat the menu until the user selects Exit.
Step 10: Stop.
